["xOffset"] = 0,
["desc"] = "Add Bloodlust\n- Time Warp\n- Heroism\n- Bloodlust\n- Primal Rage\n- Fury of the Aspects\n\nAdd Battle Ress \n- Soulstone\n- Raise Ally\n- Rebirth\n- Intercession\n- Arclight Vital Correctors\n\nAdd Evoker\n- Emerald Communion\n\nRemove\n- Ashen Hallow\n\nEdit Power Infusion.\n---------------\n\n\n\n--------------------------------\nthanks to Tocbar from RVD who helped me to fix this.\n\nEverything works again without errors. \n\nNew instance type added.\n-----------------------------\n\nThank you for that suggestion!\nKatalyst,Ika,Tocbar,Tyranus \n\nAn Thanks to Guild\nNox Infesta (The Council of Dalaran)",
